ion, who had Todd kidnapped to gain its whereabouts. Thunderok eventually was used when the Huntik Foundation team rescued Todd. He defeated Lee Roy's Bonelasher and Executioner. [The Titan of the Stage]\n\n== Abilities ==\nBeides being able to fly, Thunderok can fire blasts of hot energy from his mouth. \n\n== Gallery ==\n\nThunderok_Guitar.png|Thunderok's guitar\nThunderok.jpg|Thunderok","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox Titan\n|image = File:Thunderok.jpg\n|attack = ?\n|defense = ?\n|type = [[Draco-Titan]]\n|ability = Flight\n|first = [[The Titan of the Stage]]\n|user = [[Todd]]\n}}\n\n'''Thunderok''' is a powerful, winged [[Draco-Titan]] with blue skin and armor. He resides in a guitar, in contrast to most other [[Titans]] who instead reside in [[Amulets]].\n\n== History ==\nThunderok's [[Amulet]] was sought by [[the Organization]], who had [[Todd]] kidnapped to gain its whereabouts. Thunderok eventually was used when the [[Huntik Foundation]] team rescued Todd. He defeated [[Lee Roy]]'s [[Bonelasher]] and [[Executioner]]. {{Source|The Titan of the Stage}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nBeides being able to fly, Thunderok can fire blasts of hot energy from his mouth. \n\n{{clear}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery>\nThunderok_Guitar.png|Thunderok's guitar\nThunderok.jpg|Thunderok\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Comic Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","categories":["Comic Titans","Draco-Titans","Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Draco-Titan","label":"Draco-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2831","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Draco-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Draco-Titans"},{"target_title":"The Titan of the Stage","label":"The Titan of the Stage","target_id":"huntik:page:12996","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Titan_of_the_Stage","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12996"},{"target_title":"Todd","label":"Todd","target_id":"huntik:page:18486","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/w